    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Branagan Estates are pleased to offer for sale this extended 3 bedroom property perfectly located in the centre of Dunboyne Village with all amenities on your doorstep including shops, schools, restaurants, pubs, supermarkets, bus routes and train station. Accommodation includes an entrance hall, living room, family room, an open plan extended kitchen/dining area and bathroom, while upstairs there are 3 bedrooms and a main bathroom. Outside the front garden is walled with gates and paved for off street parking while the rear garden has a patio area, block built shed and rear access via gates.  All major road networks are easily accessible via the nearby N3, which also gives easy access to the Blanchardstown Centre, M50 and Dublin Airport. Viewing through our Dunboyne Office."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t\t2.96m x 1.86m\tWith a tiled floor      \r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t\t3.94m x 3.84m\tIt has an open fireplace with electric fire and a wooden floor \r\n\r\nFamily Room: \t\t5.05m x 2.56m\tWith a laminate wooden floor \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area:   6.89m x 4.35m    Open plan area with fitted kitchen, tiled splashback, tiled floor and breakfast counter. Dining area with a wooden floor.    \r\n\r\nBathroom (downstairs):\t3.05m x 0.80m\tWith shower, wc and whb   \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t3.80m x 2.67m \tA double bedroom with built in wardrobes and a laminate wooden floor  \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t3.29m x 2.59m \tA double bedroom with built in wardrobes and a laminate wooden floor  \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t2.86m x 2.68m \tA single bedroom with built in wardrobes and a laminate wooden floor      \r\n\r\nBathroom:   \t1.86m x 1.65m\tFully tiled with triton power shower, wc, whb and hot towel rail \r\n\r\nHeating: \tGas Fired Central Heating \r\n\r\n\r\nNotice: Please note that we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these or indeed any items.  All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only. Whilst every effort is taken to ensure the accuracy of this information, Branagan Estates shall not be held liable for any inaccuracies or omissions. Interested parties must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all of the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report or hand out issued by or on behalf of Branagan Estates or the vendor. No person in the employment of Branagan Estates has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatsoever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tExtended to rear, circa 107sqm/1,150sqft\r\n•\tLarge open plan kitchen/dining area \r\n•\tSouth facing front garden\r\n•\tOff street parking\r\n•\tHouse wrapped\r\n•\tNew gas boiler  \r\n•\tWalking distance to the centre of Dunboyne village"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D1"
      }
    ],
